{#
  Coverage-area section (harta de acoperire, 2026-08-30) — shared across all
  3 pages exactly like partials/contact.njk, placed right before it. The map
  itself is a self-hosted SVG (assets/coverage-map.svg) loaded via <img>, not
  inlined here — that keeps ~167KB of path data out of every page's HTML
  (loaded and cached once instead of tripled across index/daikin/value) and
  still gets automatic dark-mode colors, since the SVG carries its own
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) block that the browser evaluates
  independently of this page's Tailwind dark: classes.

  Deliberately no heading/subtitle/legend around it (owner call, 2026-08-30 —
  "imi place harta propriu zisa, dar nu am nevoie de textul de sus si de
  legenda de jos") — just the map image, section padding for breathing room
  against the sections above/below.

  A visible county-list paragraph was added below the image on 2026-08-31
  (optimization audit item 4.2) and then REMOVED the same day at the
  owner's request ("langa harta de acoperire nu vreau text... nu am nevoie
  sa insiruim toate orasele in acel text separat") — just the map image,
  full stop, same as the original 2026-08-30 call. Don't re-add a text
  list here without being asked again. (site.areaServed — the county
  list itself — still lives in src/_data/site.js and still feeds the
  JSON-LD areaServed field; only the on-page visible text was reverted.)

  Tiers (see the SVG's own <desc> for the full county list):
    Brăila         — sediul nostru (ember-500)
    Zonă apropiată — intervenție rapidă (ice-400 fill in the map)
    Zonă extinsă   — la cerere, pentru proiecte mai mari (ice-100 fill)
#}
<section id="acoperire" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-ice-950 scroll-mt-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="reveal max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <img src="assets/coverage-map.svg"
           alt="Harta zonei de acoperire Caloric: Brăila (sediu), zonă apropiată — Galați, Vrancea, Buzău, Vaslui, Ialomița, Tulcea, Ilfov, București, Călărași, Constanța — și zonă extinsă — Iași, Brașov, Argeș, Bacău, Dâmbovița, Prahova, Covasna, Neamț, Giurgiu."
           class="w-full h-auto drop-shadow-xl" width="960" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
